  "question": {
    "text": "A alternating current at any instant is given by $i=[6+\\sqrt{56} \\sin (100 \\pi t+\\pi / 3)]$ A. The $r m s$ value of the current is ________ A.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & I_{D N s}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\int i^2 d t}{\\int d t}} \\\\ & I_{D n s}=\\sqrt{(6)^2+\\frac{(\\sqrt{56})^2}{2}} \\\\ & =\\sqrt{36+28} \\\\ & =\\sqrt{64} \\\\ & =8 \\mathrm{~A}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
